WEBVTT

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:16.490
It almost feels like a shame 
to wake her, but...

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:22.860
We were using that magic item, and...

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:27.080
In the future, make sure you check 
its effect range before using it.

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:29.960
I'm sorry! 
I'll be more careful next time!

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:33.710
Huh? Where am I?

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:40.100
Hey! What the heck?! 
Who did this?!

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:41.850
Ah! Was it you, Iris?!

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:43.670
Dunno what you're talking about...

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:45.580
The heck you don't!

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:20.990
<b>Episode 10</b>

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:20.990
<b>The Strongest Sage Works With a Team.</b>

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:27.240
This is Folkia? It's creepy...

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:30.710
I can feel a demonic magical signature 
in the city...

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:32.270
But this is...

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:33.930
Did you notice it too, Lurie?

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:37.450
Yes. Faint signatures scattered all over.

00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:39.220
Over thirty of them!

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:42.480
Precisely. 
The reason the signatures feel small

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:44.200
is probably that they're concealing them.

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:44.900
What?!

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:46.020
But that means...

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:50.330
Yes. Folkia is full of demons.

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:54.170
Thirty demons in the city?! 
How is that possible?

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:57.250
Yeah! You said demons didn't like 
to work in groups!

00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:58.530
I'm impressed you remembered that.

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:01.780
It's true that typical demons 
don't work in groups.

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:03.740
But demidemons are different.

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:05.200
"Demidemons"?

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:08.420
A rare offshoot of the demon race.

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:10.330
They can't use any special spells,

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:13.650
but they work in groups and fight as a team.

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:16.150
If they're the ones in control of the city,

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:19.170
that's the most troublesome
situation I can imagine.

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:21.950
Security's pretty tight, too.

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:24.640
Now that we know 
the city's brimming with demons,

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:27.300
there's no need 
to go right through the front door.

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:29.200
Then what should we do?

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:32.440
I found something very interesting.

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:41.420
What in the world?!

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:44.270
A hidden passage for the demons.

00:03:44.270 --> 00:03:47.160
It should lead us 
right to the city center.

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:50.930
All right, let's infiltrate Folkia.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:01.170
Kinda stinks in here...

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:03.130
Is this a sewer system?

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:05.860
It's so dark. 
It's almost like a maze.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:15.850
Just a rat!

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:19.560
I was so scared! 
I thought it might be a small monster.

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:22.480
Er, um... Lurie?

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:25.820
Oh... 
Sorry! Sorry! Sorry!

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:28.350
Seriously, it's fine.

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:29.280
In fact, I...

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:30.000
What?

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.290
N-Nothing! 
Let's keep going!

00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:40.880
Stop here.

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:42.970
Ouch!

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:45.470
My detection spell is picking something up.

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:49.470
There's a demon just ahead.

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:50.720
What should we do?

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:52.600
Should we destroy it?

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:55.440
No, we're going to pass right by.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:56.400
Huh?

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:58.150
You guys wait here.

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:02.660
He went into the wall!

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:04.850
A simple application of a spell.

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:16.820
<i>It went perfectly. Come over here.</i>

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:21.140
He appears to be their only lookout.

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:23.550
What did you do to him?

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:25.290
I used a stupefaction spell.

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:29.120
It temporarily dulls the target's senses.

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:30.260
Okay, let's hurry.

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:33.440
Come on, Iris. 
No drawing on him.

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:39.150
I can't believe we're passing 
right in front of a demon.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:41.230
Nyah, nyah, nyah!

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:55.140
Now that we're in here, 
it feels even worse.

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:58.170
Yeah. Melkia was pretty desolate,

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:00.910
but this is creepy 
in a totally different way.

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:12.490
The townspeople seem to be 
in a kind of a trance.

00:06:12.490 --> 00:06:13.890
Are they all right?

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:16.660
The magical signatures are strange, too.

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:17.850
Can it be...

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:21.040
If I may.

00:06:24.470 --> 00:06:26.880
He has some kind of spell 
cast on him, doesn't he?

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:29.490
Yes. It's called Thought Paralysis.

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:31.450
It's a type of stupefaction spell.

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:34.160
The adventurers are all acting the same way!

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:36.870
This must be the demons' work!

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:47.760
Next!

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:51.470
Okay, next!

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:53.760
<i>Wow, they're casting Thought Paralysis 
on everyone!</i>

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:57.680
<i>That one over there is a demon, isn't it?</i>

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.200
<i>It definitely is.</i>

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:03.590
<i>They're working the humans 
in this factory to some end.</i>

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:05.610
<i>We'll have to go inside 
and see what it is.</i>

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:10.620
<i>A defense spell.</i>

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:13.780
<i>This will nullify the Thought Paralysis spell, 
if they try to cast it on us.</i>

00:07:14.110 --> 00:07:17.620
<i>We'll pretend it works, 
then march right through the front gate.</i>

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:19.020
<i>That goes for you too, Iris.</i>

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:20.880
<i>Act like you're spaced out.</i>

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:23.630
<i>Okay! Spaced out, huh?</i>

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:29.630
<i>Spaced out... Spaced out... 
Spaced out...</i>

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:33.720
Hey, you! What are you doing?

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:35.180
<i>This isn't good.</i>

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:37.650
An overdose of Thought Paralysis?

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:40.320
I guess someone went a little overboard.

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:44.310
They should know 
that overdosing decreases efficiency.

00:07:44.870 --> 00:07:47.270
You're all fine. Go on ahead.

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:48.570
Yes, sir...

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:53.910
<i>I guess that went pretty well.</i>

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:56.120
<i>You're amazing, Iris!</i>

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:59.200
<i>I didn't exactly do it on purpose.</i>

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:01.660
<i>All the more reason it worked!</i>

00:08:08.440 --> 00:08:10.730
<i>Look at this huge place!</i>

00:08:10.730 --> 00:08:13.550
<i>You think they're refining ore?</i>

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:15.460
<i>It does appear so.</i>

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:18.260
<i>Their equipment is far more advanced 
than I'd imagined.</i>

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:21.270
<i>It does seem 
to be a rather large production.</i>

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:25.540
<i>But why are they collecting 
these weird rocks?</i>

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:28.650
<i>This is Rankine magical ore.</i>

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:32.690
<i>The magicrystals they refine from it 
can be used in explosives.</i>

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:33.950
<i>Explosives?!</i>

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:39.970
<i>With just one ton of crystals 
with 100 purity,</i>

00:08:39.970 --> 00:08:42.830
<i>you can blow up an entire kingdom.</i>

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:48.710
<i>Still, it would probably take decades 
to gather that many magicrystals.</i>

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:52.420
<i>But at least it's pretty clear 
what they're going for.</i>

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:58.790
<i>A facility massive enough to create weapons 
that could destroy an entire kingdom...</i>

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:03.120
<i>Is there a powerful demon with extensive knowledge 
of magical technology behind this?</i>

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:05.690
What should we do now?

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:09.770
Obviously, the factory is too dangerous 
to be left standing.

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:14.220
And the Thought Paralysis spell 
can have permanent negative effects

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:17.540
on the human brain after extended usage.

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:20.700
Then there's just one thing to do!

00:09:21.170 --> 00:09:22.170
<i>Indeed.</i>

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:29.710
Wipe out the demons!

00:09:30.780 --> 00:09:33.530
There are thirty-two demidemons 
that I can detect.

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:35.220
They're distributed roughly like this.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:38.680
They seem primarily gathered 
in the city center.

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:41.550
Demidemons are good at teamwork, right?

00:09:41.550 --> 00:09:42.940
Will we have to wait 
until they're separated?

00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:45.390
No, it's unlikely 
that they'll split up on their own.

00:09:45.690 --> 00:09:48.340
The major facilities are concentrated 
in the center of the city,

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:51.860
so they'll all remain within range 
of their shared consciousness.

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:53.920
Shared consciousness?

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:57.490
So if we destroy one of them, 
the other demons will know right away?

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:00.700
So we have to take them all at once?

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:03.240
We'd definitely die if we tried that.

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:05.010
But that's fine.

00:10:05.010 --> 00:10:06.160
How, exactly?!

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:09.120
We'll use their teamwork against them.

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:12.710
Allow me to explain my plan.

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:24.060
Unknown magical signature
detected in area 51.

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.320
<i>Full alert! 
It's a massive signature!</i>

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:30.840
Locate and dispatch the source 
of the signature at once.

00:10:30.840 --> 00:10:33.480
Surround area 51 entirely!

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.460
I've arrived in area 50.

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:37.600
<i>No sign of the enemy.</i>

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:40.370
<i>I'm in area 52. 
No sign here, either.</i>

00:10:40.370 --> 00:10:44.280
Scouts, report to me 
the minute you catch sight of the enemy.

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:46.370
On our way! Requesting backup!

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:48.170
<i>Currently on the move from area 50.</i>

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:49.530
We'll meet up with you soon.

00:10:49.530 --> 00:10:51.010
<i>Will be there soon, too.</i>

00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:53.210
<i>Let's surround them 
and clear them all out at once!</i>

00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:58.380
Gradually draw in 
once the encirclement is complete.

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:01.720
I don't know who that is down there, 
but we've got them trapped like a rat.

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:03.430
Now nearing target!

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:05.540
Hey, is that...

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:06.920
Found you!

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:12.600
What the—?!

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:16.940
They got one of us? 
Did they realize we're here?

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:18.780
Maintain formation!

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:22.570
<i>What now?!</i>

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:25.850
<i>They got another of us?! 
What's going on here?</i>

00:11:25.850 --> 00:11:27.740
<i>An explosion? It's a trap!</i>

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:31.270
Impossible! Our earlier patrols didn't spot 
anything out of the ordinary.

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:34.330
Not again!

00:11:35.900 --> 00:11:36.920
<i>An explosion—</i>

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:41.130
What in the world is going on here?

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:47.740
This is my plan:

00:11:47.740 --> 00:11:49.530
This is our starting point.

00:11:49.530 --> 00:11:53.850
I masked Iris's tremendous magical signature 
when we first arrived in the city,

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:56.060
but I'm going to unmask it all at once.

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:08.620
When they pick up on that, 
the demidemons will start to gather around her.

00:12:08.880 --> 00:12:10.650
I mainly want you on standby,

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:13.580
but if you see them start to form groups, 
move around to distract them.

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:16.340
Um, so I'm basically...

00:12:16.340 --> 00:12:20.880
Iris, you'll be luring the demons away 
from the center of the city...

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:21.800
Like a decoy.

00:12:22.190 --> 00:12:26.470
Why is that always the role 
I get stuck with?

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:28.880
It just means 
that I know you can handle it.

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:31.700
I'll do my best!

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:33.810
I'm counting on you.

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:39.320
The rest of us will remain in hiding 
and take them out one at a time.

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:41.900
<i>So I just need to hold their attention?</i>

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:46.570
Come and get me!

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:53.460
That hurt, okay?!

00:12:55.240 --> 00:12:57.460
<i>Don't get too far ahead. 
Withdraw for now.</i>

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:04.630
Matthias!

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:06.960
I beat one!

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:08.160
Keep it up!

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:09.620
Stay on the move, Iris!

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:11.250
Okay!

00:13:11.960 --> 00:13:14.050
<i>That makes eight.</i>

00:13:14.050 --> 00:13:18.950
<i>The demidemons should assume 
it's just Iris picking them off.</i>

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:22.360
<i>Time to turn up the pressure!</i>

00:13:22.910 --> 00:13:25.460
<i>Lurie! Alma! 
The demons are on the way!</i>

00:13:25.460 --> 00:13:26.700
<i>Understood!</i>

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:29.360
<i>Alma!</i>

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:30.200
<i>Okay!</i>

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:34.200
<i>Now!</i>

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:39.710
<i>I infused the magistones 
with a mere explosion spell.</i>

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:42.940
<i>Obviously, that's not enough 
to defeat a demon.</i>

00:13:42.940 --> 00:13:46.070
<i>But it's perfect for distracting them!</i>

00:13:46.670 --> 00:13:48.010
That makes thirteen.

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:50.520
<i>They got another of us! 
What's going on here?!</i>

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:51.960
<i>What's going on now?</i>

00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:53.770
<i>An explosion? Another trap?</i>

00:13:53.770 --> 00:13:56.940
<i>Impossible! 
Our earlier patrols didn't notice anything—</i>

00:13:58.370 --> 00:13:59.390
<i>An explosion—</i>

00:14:00.920 --> 00:14:03.610
What in the world is going on here?

00:14:04.220 --> 00:14:07.800
<i>Demidemons are always in contact 
via shared consciousness.</i>

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:10.570
<i>But this allows misinformation 
to disseminate quickly as well.</i>

00:14:10.570 --> 00:14:13.570
<i>Right now, they probably think 
the town's been rigged</i>

00:14:13.570 --> 00:14:15.540
<i>with all kinds of powerful traps.</i>

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:17.940
<i>All of you, stay still for now!</i>

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:20.080
<i>Use a detection spell to locate the traps!</i>

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:22.790
<i>Just as I anticipated.</i>

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:25.520
<i>Lurie, Alma, use Conceal Magic!</i>

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:26.380
<i>Right!</i>

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:29.020
<i>It will temporarily dim their magical signatures</i>

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:31.840
<i>to roughly the levels of the townspeople.</i>

00:14:31.840 --> 00:14:33.850
<i>Even if the demons use a detection spell,</i>

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:37.390
<i>they won't be able to differentiate the girls 
from the locals addled by Thought Paralysis.</i>

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:41.210
<i>This is area 50. 
No magical signatures of traps detected.</i>

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:44.480
<i>Same here. 
No unusual magical signatures at all!</i>

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:46.980
<i>We cleared the demons' detection spell.</i>

00:14:46.980 --> 00:14:50.570
<i>We need to take more out 
before they complete their encirclement.</i>

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:51.660
<i>Right!</i>

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:54.010
<i>Moving to next area now!</i>

00:14:54.010 --> 00:14:55.780
<i>Once I confirm a safe route,</i>

00:14:55.780 --> 00:14:57.750
<i>I'll move right for the enemy 
with the powerful magic—</i>

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:59.740
<i>We have a loss in area 50!</i>

00:14:59.740 --> 00:15:02.160
<i>Impossible! 
We confirmed there were no traps—</i>

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:06.640
<i>Losses in areas 41, 53, and 48!</i>

00:15:06.640 --> 00:15:08.840
<i>Is it some kind of trap we can't detect?!</i>

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:11.120
Can't detect?

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:14.380
How could they could set up traps 
across such a wide area

00:15:14.380 --> 00:15:17.560
in a city we're monitoring at all times?

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:19.310
Can it be...

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:26.500
<i>You're not the only ones 
who can work as a team!</i>

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:27.800
<i>Lurie.</i>

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:29.210
<i>Alma.</i>

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:30.320
<i>Iris.</i>

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:34.640
<i>Demidemons might do well at teamwork, 
but we'll disrupt it with our own!</i>

00:15:39.820 --> 00:15:41.620
<i>That makes twenty-two.</i>

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:47.040
<i>It really is good to have a team.</i>

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:54.960
<i>Listen, all of you!</i>

00:15:54.960 --> 00:15:58.380
<i>I'm picking up two magical signatures 
on the bodies of one of the dead.</i>

00:15:58.380 --> 00:16:01.270
<i>And he wasn't killed by an explosion, 
but a sword.</i>

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:04.480
<i>Someone's hiding out there and attacking us!</i>

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:08.070
<i>The demons' movements have changed.</i>

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:10.530
<i>Everyone, wait right where you are!</i>

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:13.030
<i>They're all gathering in one location?</i>

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:15.490
<i>They must have realized 
there really aren't any traps.</i>

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:18.170
<i>We'll have to take on 
however many are left face to face.</i>

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:22.940
We'll deal with the secret assassin later.

00:16:22.940 --> 00:16:25.340
The fact that they went 
with a divide and conquer strategy

00:16:25.340 --> 00:16:28.630
suggests that they don't stand a chance 
against our united front.

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:29.460
You're right!

00:16:29.460 --> 00:16:32.990
We'll deal with the one broadcasting 
its magical signature first.

00:16:32.990 --> 00:16:34.770
But that one's just a decoy.

00:16:34.770 --> 00:16:36.520
It'll be dangerous to approach.

00:16:36.520 --> 00:16:38.000
Then how...

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:40.310
Meet fire with fire.

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:42.230
You want to use the magicrystals?!

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:43.240
Are you sure about that?!

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:46.690
Desperate times call for desperate measures!

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:50.420
We must purge the enemy, even if it means 
blowing up half the city with it.

00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:52.090
Humans are replaceable, anyway.

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:54.840
We can get more of them 
any time we need!

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:57.040
I'll fetch the magicrystals, then—

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:05.710
You've finally shown yourself, assassin?

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:08.680
Blow up the city, huh?

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:11.400
You demons are freakin' crazy!

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:13.660
Guess I was right to come...

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:17.310
<i>That magical signature...</i>

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:19.680
<i>Then the one currently fighting them is...</i>

00:17:38.060 --> 00:17:39.840
My late comrades cry out for vengeance.

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:41.870
Don't expect me to grant you 
a painless death.

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:44.580
Now there's a fun claim...

00:17:45.230 --> 00:17:47.250
You damned demons!

00:17:47.990 --> 00:17:49.150
Surround him.

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:51.140
We'll take him out quickly.

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:53.510
<i>Giluas, just as I thought!</i>

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:56.090
<i>He's completely exposed from behind.</i>

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:05.480
<i>Just four left!</i>

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:06.630
He came from behind?!

00:18:06.630 --> 00:18:08.190
There's another one?

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:19.860
Are you all right?

00:18:19.860 --> 00:18:21.760
Yeah, well done.

00:18:21.760 --> 00:18:23.950
But Iris, 
I told you to be on standby!

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:27.080
Sorry. I got tired of playing decoy!

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:30.820
Well, at least you showed up 
with good timing and control.

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:34.800
I figured you'd dodge, 
so I threw it right at you!

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:47.850
That won't work on me!

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:51.650
Are you all right, Giluas?

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:54.540
Looks like you're finished 
over there already!

00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:57.520
And it appears you're struggling a bit.

00:18:57.520 --> 00:18:58.820
Shut up!

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:00.840
You destroyed them all?

00:19:00.840 --> 00:19:03.100
An impressive feat...

00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:06.540
But I'll murder you insects 
with my own hands!

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:08.060
That's a pretty tall order.

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:10.510
Matthias, how about you stay out of this?

00:19:10.510 --> 00:19:11.880
He's a strong one.

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:14.060
That's just why I'm here!

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:17.340
This is my fight! 
I ain't gonna let you have it!

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:22.970
Here we go!

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:28.250
<i>His Enhance Physique spells 
have grown more precise.</i>

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:30.350
<i>He must have been reading my book.</i>

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:32.090
Hey, look!

00:19:32.090 --> 00:19:33.500
Giluas?!

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:34.690
He's injured!

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:38.360
Yes, but he's avoiding fatal wounds 
by a hair's breadth.

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:39.870
Very impressive.

00:19:39.870 --> 00:19:43.110
But the demon he's fighting 
is quite talented as well.

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:47.510
Your blade can't hurt me!

00:19:47.510 --> 00:19:49.290
Don't you realize that yet?

00:19:49.590 --> 00:19:51.620
Shut your stupid mouth already!

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.960
Recoil Sunder Steel!

00:19:58.160 --> 00:20:00.080
I told you it wouldn't work!

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:03.590
All right!

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:05.340
<i>"Recoil Sunder Steel"...</i>

00:20:05.340 --> 00:20:07.930
<i>Impressive that he worked that one out.</i>

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:10.800
<i>It's a spell that gives you the cutting power 
to slice through iron,</i>

00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:13.480
<i>but as the name suggests, 
it's a double-edged sword</i>

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:15.360
<i>that takes a toll on your own body.</i>

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:18.150
Arrogant fool! It's not over yet!

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:23.150
<i>Is this his limit?</i>

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:25.240
Not yet!

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:28.580
Recoil Sunder Steel! Double-Strike!

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:34.990
<i>Two Recoil Sunder Steels at once...</i>

00:20:35.690 --> 00:20:37.640
<i>That really must be his limit.</i>

00:20:38.100 --> 00:20:40.090
You've come impressively far,

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:44.260
but I'll use my ultimate attack 
to take you down once and for all!

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:48.180
Sounds like fun. Bring it on.

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:50.890
I'll hit you with all the magic I got!

00:20:51.530 --> 00:20:53.100
This is the end!

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:54.810
For you, sure!

00:20:55.130 --> 00:20:56.270
Demonic Slash!

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:03.220
Recoil Sunder Steel!

00:21:22.430 --> 00:21:24.050
Damn you...

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:32.430
I freakin' won!

00:21:33.050 --> 00:21:34.390
You okay?!

00:21:34.880 --> 00:21:36.760
By a hair's breadth indeed...

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:38.400
A magnificent victory.

00:21:39.690 --> 00:21:40.740
Ow, ow...

00:21:40.740 --> 00:21:42.980
I can't move a damn muscle.

00:21:44.940 --> 00:21:46.680
What are we going to do with you?

00:21:46.680 --> 00:21:48.920
I'll cast a healing spell now.

00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:51.990
I'm hungry!

00:23:27.050 --> 00:23:28.640
Iris is sleeping!

00:23:28.640 --> 00:23:32.040
I'll have my revenge 
and draw on her face instead!

00:23:33.950 --> 00:23:37.710
I can't do it! I can't bring myself 
to draw on such an adorable face!

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Episode 11 
The Strongest Sage Faces a Powerful Enemy.</b>

00:23:37.710 --> 00:23:39.510
What in the world are you doing?
